      <h1>How to Create a WhatsApp Group QR Code Standee for Gyms, Cafes & Stores (2026 Guide)</h1>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;">Nazim · Social Ninja's</a></span><span>·</span><span>Sep 28, 2026</span><span>·</span><span>6 min read</span>
      </div>
      <p class="article-intro">Walk into modern fitness studios, artisan cafes, or boutique coworking spaces today, and you will notice a sleek acrylic standee sitting right beside the billing counter: <strong>"Scan to join our members WhatsApp group"</strong>. Here is the complete playbook for designing, printing, and managing your own branded WhatsApp group QR standee.</p>
