      </div>

      <h2>Why Physical QR Standees Are Outperforming Digital Links</h2>
      <p>For local brick-and-mortar businesses, converting in-person footfall into an engaged online community has always been a struggle. Email newsletters suffer from 15% open rates, and social media algorithms throttle organic reach down to 2%.</p>
      <p>WhatsApp, by contrast, commands a staggering <strong>98% open rate</strong>. Placing an attractive QR code standee at high-dwell areas (reception desks, payment counters, locker room exits, or dining tables) captures customers at the exact moment their satisfaction and attention are highest.</p>

